{"id":"b3eb56280c44811b","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-rel-converse-relation.md","title":"ZFC Rel Converse Relation","display":"df-zfc-rel-converse-relation — ZFC Rel Converse Relation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-rel-converse-relation","aliases":["58-df-zfc-rel-converse-relation"],"display":"df-zfc-rel-converse-relation — ZFC Rel Converse Relation","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-rel-converse-relation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-rel-converse-relation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-rel-converse-relation — ZFC Rel Converse Relation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,S\\in V\">\\(R,S\\in V\\)</span> (relation and converse candidates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRelConverseRelation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRelConverseRelation}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}converse\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRelConverseRelation}_S(S,R)\\leftrightarrow S=\\{\\langle y,x\\rangle\\mid\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}converse\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRelConverseRelation}_S(S,R)\\leftrightarrow S=\\{\\langle y,x\\rangle\\mid\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The candidate converse <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> is kept distinct from the derived notation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^{-1}\">\\(R^{-1}\\)</span>, and ordered pairs use the ambient ZFC coding.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R,S\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRelConverseRelation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}converse\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRelConverseRelation}_S(S,R)\\leftrightarrow S=\\{\\langle y,x\\rangle\\mid\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\}","display":true},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"R^{-1}","display":false}],"bytes":783,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3304","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-rel-converse-relation.md|58-df-zfc-rel-converse-relation]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3"]}